WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.200
What needs my attention today?

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.380
The answer is spread across your company,

3
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:07.000
in emails, records and conversations.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.040
HAI Seed is software that connects AI

5
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.060
to your company’s information, rules and tools,

6
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.620
so your team can get work done

7
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.460
without explaining the business from scratch every time.

8
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.440
Existing AI models provide the reasoning.

9
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.200
HAI brings your business into the task.

10
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:31.980
HAI connects selected sources into a working memory for your company,

11
00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.700
linking records, decisions and follow-ups across tasks.

12
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.400
After a management meeting,

13
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.820
HAI checks commitments against company records,

14
00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.640
email and earlier decisions.

15
00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.720
Open items return in the next review,

16
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.640
with a named owner and a recommended next step.

17
00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.280
Now ask bigger questions.

18
00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.220
Where are sales getting stuck?

19
00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:54.800
What is tying up cash?

20
00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.320
What should we know before meeting this customer?

21
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.840
The same company context can support

22
00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.480
analysis, proposals, marketing, procurement and onboarding guidance.

23
00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.940
You get prepared work and a clearer basis for decisions.

24
00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:16.600
Recurring checks keep HAI active between conversations.

25
00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.080
It spots changes before you think to ask,

26
00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:22.320
prepares priorities and carries agreed follow-ups forward.

27
00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.500
Your team decides what to do.

28
00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:27.160
Teach it as you work.

29
00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:28.900
Share a reliable source.

30
00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:30.020
Correct an assumption.

31
00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.880
Confirm what it should remember.

32
00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.340
The next task starts from that knowledge.

33
00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:38.660
Start on a supported company computer

34
00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.400
or a preconfigured machine.

35
00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:43.280
A dedicated engineer guides the self-onboarding.

36
00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.400
Then expand across teams,

37
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.280
each person with the knowledge and access their role needs.

38
00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.860
Company memory is stored on your machine.

39
00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:55.500
Connected AI services process information used for the task.

40
00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:58.040
You choose the sources and access you grant.

41
00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.460
HAI Seed. Talk to your company.
